FUNCTION HTTPGETFILE(URL, TARGET)
* mvx-lang/curl — download URL to TARGET via libcurl through jBASE DEFC
* (JBCURLGETFILE), returning the HTTP status (-1 transport error, -2 cannot open
* TARGET).  Redirect and binary handling are libcurl's; a GitHub release URL 302s
* to the CDN.  GPL-2.0-only.
*
* TARGET, not PATH: jBASE reserves a long list of ordinary words, and a reserved
* name as a parameter fails at compile time with an error that names the line
* rather than the word.
   DEFC VAR JBCURLGETFILE(VAR, VAR)
   RC = JBCURLGETFILE(URL, TARGET)
   RETURN(RC)
